# Saved candidate (i) solutions (candidate_i.py --save, C-i4): <field>_<eps>_<N>_<cand>.npz.
# Only the 16^3 files (~0.1 MB) are committed; N >= 24 files are local only and are regenerated by re-running
# the command recorded in the README (or recomputed metrics-only with candidate_i.py --remetric FILE).
*.npz
!*_16_*.npz
